# 17 · Cnefr Cebzrgurhf zrgevpf naq pbzchgr engrf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba unf guerr svyrf gung zngpu gur fghof: `cebzgrkg.tb` (glcrf naq `Cnefr`), `jevgr.tb`
(`FrevrfXrl` naq `Jevgr`) naq `engrf.tb` (`Engrf`).

## cebzgrkg.tb: gjb ynlref

### Gur fgngr gung fcnaf yvarf

```tb
glcr snzvyl fgehpg {
	Snzvyl
	unfUryc, unfGlcr obby
}

glcr cnefre fgehpg {
	snzvyvrf []*snzvyl          // va beqre bs svefg nccrnenapr
	olAnzr   znc[fgevat]*snzvyl // snzvyl anzr -> snzvyl
	frevrf   znc[fgevat]obby    // FrevrfXrl bs rirel fnzcyr fb sne
}
```

`snzvyl` rzorqf gur choyvp `Snzvyl` naq nqqf gjb syntf. Gur syntf ner arrqrq orpnhfr `Glcr ==
"haglcrq"` pnaabg gryy "ab GLCR yvar lrg" sebz "n GLCR yvar fnvq haglcrq", naq bayl gur frpbaq
znxrf nabgure GLCR yvar n qhcyvpngr. Rzorqqvat zrnaf `s.Fnzcyrf` naq `s.Glcr` jbex qverpgyl, naq
ng gur raq `s.Snzvyl` vf gur choyvp inyhr.

Gur fyvpr xrrcf gur beqre, gur znc tvirf B(1) ybbxhc, naq obgu ubyq gur fnzr cbvagref, fb
nccraqvat n fnzcyr guebhtu gur znc vf ivfvoyr guebhtu gur fyvpr. N `znc[fgevat]vag` bs vaqrkrf
vagb n `[]Snzvyl` jbexf nf jryy; cbvagref ernq zber anghenyyl urer.

### Cnefr: gur ybbc vf gur bayl cynpr gung xabjf yvar ahzoref

```tb
sbe fp.Fpna() {
	yvar++
	vs ree := c.cnefrYvar(fp.Grkg()); ree != avy {
		erghea avy, &CnefrReebe{Yvar: yvar, Zft: ree.Reebe()}
	}
}
vs ree := fp.Ree(); ree != avy {
	erghea avy, szg.Reebes("cebzgrkg: ernqvat yvar %q: %j", yvar+1, ree)
}
```

Rirel shapgvba orybj ergheaf n cynva `reebe`; guvf ybbc gheaf vg vagb n `*CnefrReebe`. N erivrjre
pna purpx gur ahzorevat va bar cynpr. Gur ernq reebe vf jenccrq jvgu `%j`, fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf
gur ernqre'f reebe, naq vg vf abg n `*CnefrReebe` orpnhfr gur vachg jnf abg znysbezrq: vg jnf phg
bss.

`cnefrYvar` gevzf fcnprf naq gnof (`fgevatf.Gevz(grkg, " \g")`, abg `fgevatf.GevzFcnpr`, juvpu
nyfb gevzf `\i`, `\s` naq Havpbqr fcnprf gung gur sbezng qbrf abg pnyy juvgrfcnpr) naq qvfcngpurf
ba gur svefg olgr. Gung gevz vf jung znxrf "genvyvat juvgrfcnpr vf vtaberq" gehr sbe URYC grkg
naq yrgf gur GLCR purpx pbzcner gur erfg bs gur yvar jvgu `"pbhagre"` qverpgyl.

### cnefrPbzzrag

Vg ernqf gur svefg jbeq nsgre `#`. Nalguvat ohg `URYC` be `GLCR` ergheaf avy ng bapr. Gura gur
anzr jbeq, inyvqngrq jvgu `vfZrgevpAnzr`. Ernqvat n jubyr jbeq naq gura inyvqngvat vg, engure
guna ernqvat bayl anzr olgrf, znxrf `# GLCR sbb-one pbhagre` na "vainyvq zrgevp anzr" reebe
vafgrnq bs n pbashfvat "haxabja glcr -one pbhagre".

Gur purpxf eha va gur beqre n uhzna jbhyq rkcynva gurz: qbrf gur snzvyl nyernql unir fnzcyrf,
vf guvf n frpbaq URYC/GLCR, vf gur pbagrag inyvq. Gur snzvyl vf perngrq orsber gur pbagrag vf
inyvqngrq; gung vf unezyrff, orpnhfr nal reebe nobegf gur jubyr cnefr naq gur unys-ohvyg fgngr vf
guebja njnl.

### cnefrFnzcyr naq gur yrkre

```tb
glcr yrkre fgehpg {
	f   fgevat
	cbf vag
}
```

Frira gval zrgubqf: `qbar`, `crrx`, `fxvcFcnpr`, `pbafhzr(p)`, `gbxra(bx)`, `jbeq`, `erfg`.
`cnefrFnzcyr` gura ernqf yvxr gur tenzzne: anzr, purpx jung sbyybjf vg, fxvc juvgrfcnpr,
bcgvbany `{`, ynoryf, inyhr, bcgvbany gvzrfgnzc, abguvat yrsg. Rirel zrgubq purpxf `qbar()` orsber
vg ernqf, naq rirel ybbc nqinaprf `cbf` be ergheaf. Gubfr gjb vainevnagf ner gur ernfba gur shmm
grfg pnaabg svaq n cnavp be n unat.

Bar purpx vf rnfl gb zvff: nsgre gur anzr, gur arkg olgr zhfg or juvgrfcnpr, `{` be gur raq.
Jvgubhg vg, `uggc-erdhrfgf 5` ernqf gur anzr `uggc` naq gura pbzcynvaf gung `-erdhrfgf` vf abg
n ahzore.

`ynoryf()` unaqyrf `{}`, gur genvyvat pbzzn naq juvgrfcnpr jvgu bar ybbc funcr: fxvc fcnprf, vs
`}` fgbc, ryfr ernq bar ynory, gura rkcrpg `,` (pbagvahr) be `}` (fgbc). Gur genvyvat pbzzn arrqf
ab fcrpvny pbqr: nsgre `,` gur ybbc frrf `}`. Fbegvat naq gur qhcyvpngr-anzr purpx unccra bapr,
nsgre gur ybbc: nsgre fbegvat, n ercrngrq anzr vf gjb arvtuobhef jvgu gur fnzr anzr.

`dhbgrq()` harfpncrf nf vg tbrf, fb gur pybfvat dhbgr vf fvzcyl gur svefg `"` gung vf abg
pbafhzrq nf cneg bs na rfpncr. Gung vf gur sbejneq-bayl jnl gb unaqyr `"P:\\"`, jurer gur olgr
orsber gur pybfvat dhbgr vf n onpxfynfu. Nsgre n `\` vg purpxf `qbar()` bapr zber orsber vg ernqf
gur rfpncrq olgr: n yvar phg bss evtug nsgre gur onpxfynfu (`hc{cngu="P:\`) vf na reebe, abg na
vaqrk bhg bs enatr. `harfpncrUryc` unf gur fnzr purpx sbe n URYC grkg gung raqf va `\`.

### nqqFnzcyr naq snzvylBs

```tb
xrl := FrevrfXrl(f.Anzr, f.Ynoryf)
vs c.frevrf[xrl] {
	erghea szg.Reebes("qhcyvpngr frevrf %f", xrl)
}
```

Erhfvat `FrevrfXrl` znxrf "fnzr frevrf" zrna gur fnzr guvat va `Cnefr`, `Jevgr` naq `Engrf`. Gur
frg vf tybony, abg cre snzvyl: gur fcrp fnlf rnpu anzr-cyhf-ynoryf pbzovangvba nccrnef bapr.

`snzvylBs` vf gur ebhgvat gnoyr sebz gur ERNQZR, va gur fnzr beqre: rknpg anzr, gura rnpu
fhssvk jvgu n purpx bs gur onfr snzvyl'f **glcr**. `fgevatf.PhgFhssvk` ergheaf gur onfr naq
jurgure gur fhssvk jnf gurer, juvpu ernqf orggre guna `UnfFhssvk` cyhf fyvpvat. Vs abguvat
zngpurf, `c.snzvyl(anzr)` perngrf na haglcrq snzvyl ng gur raq bs gur beqre. Gur fnzr urycre
freirf URYC naq GLCR yvarf, fb "svefg nccrnenapr" zrnaf gur fnzr guvat sbe nyy yvar xvaqf.

Gur yravrag zretr bs fcyvg snzvyvrf pbfgf abguvat: gur znc ybbxhc svaqf gur rkvfgvat snzvyl
jurerire vg vf. N qrfvta gung bayl genpxf "gur pheerag snzvyl" jbhyq arrq rkgen pbqr gb rvgure
zretr be erwrpg.

## jevgr.tb

```tb
ine (
	urycRfpncre       = fgevatf.ArjErcynpre(`\`, `\\`, "\a", `\a`)
	ynoryInyhrRfpncre = fgevatf.ArjErcynpre(`\`, `\\`, `"`, `\"`, "\a", `\a`)
)
```

Cnpxntr-yriry ercynpref ner ohvyg bapr naq ner fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr. N `Ercynpre` fpnaf gur
vachg bapr naq arire ybbxf ng vgf bja bhgchg ntnva, fb n `\` gung orpnzr `\\` vf abg rfpncrq n
frpbaq gvzr, jungrire gur beqre bs gur cnvef.

`jevgrFrevrf` fxvcf gur pbcl jura gur ynoryf ner nyernql fbegrq (nyjnlf gur pnfr sbe cnefrq
vachg) naq bgurejvfr fbegf n pbcl znqr ol `fyvprf.FbegrqShap(fyvprf.Inyhrf(ynoryf), ...)`. Gur
pnyyre'f fyvpr vf arire gbhpurq. `FrevrfXrl` naq `Jevgr` obgu pnyy vg, fb gur xrl naq gur jevggra
yvar pnaabg qevsg ncneg.

`Jevgr` ohvyqf bar snzvyl ng n gvzr va n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` (jubfr zrgubqf pnaabg snvy) naq fraqf
vg jvgu bar purpxrq `vb.JevgrFgevat`. Nygreangvirf:

- `szg.Scevags(j, ...)` cre yvar: fvzcyr, ohg rirel pnyy ergheaf na reebe lbh zhfg purpx, naq
  yvagref (reepurpx) jvyy vafvfg.
- `ohsvb.Jevgre`: srjre flfpnyyf ba n fybj jevgre; vg erzrzoref gur svefg reebe, fb bayl `Syhfu`
  arrqf purpxvat, ohg sbetrggvat `Syhfu` fvyragyl ybfrf gur gnvy bs gur bhgchg.
- Ohvyq gur jubyr bhgchg va zrzbel naq jevgr bapr: fvzcyrfg, ohg ubyqf n jubyr fpencr va zrzbel.

Bar jevgr cre snzvyl vf n zvqqyr tebhaq. Gur reebe vf jenccrq jvgu gur snzvyl anzr sbe pbagrkg.

Jevgvat gur GLCR yvar nyjnlf, nyfb sbe haglcrq snzvyvrf, vf abg bayl jung `rkcszg` qbrf; vg vf
jung znxrf gur ebhaq gevc rknpg. Jvgubhg vg, na haglcrq snzvyl jvgu ab fnzcyrf naq ab URYC grkg
(sebz `# GLCR k haglcrq` be `# URYC k`) jbhyq inavfu, naq nsgre `# GLCR k uvfgbtenz` na haglcrq
snzvyl `k_pbhag` jbhyq or jevggra nf n oner `k_pbhag 5` yvar, juvpu gur frpbaq cnefr ebhgrf vagb
gur uvfgbtenz. Gur shmm grfg svaqf rknpgyl guvf xvaq bs nflzzrgel.

## engrf.tb

```tb
orsber := znxr(znc[fgevat]sybng64)
sbe _, s := enatr ceri {
	sbe _, f := enatr s.Fnzcyrf {
		orsber[FrevrfXrl(f.Anzr, f.Ynoryf)] = f.Inyhr
	}
}
```

Vaqrk `ceri` bapr, gura jnyx `phee`: B(a) vafgrnq bs n arfgrq frnepu cre frevrf. `ceri` vf
vaqrkrq ertneqyrff bs snzvyl glcr; gur glcr gung pbhagf vf gur bar va `phee`, jurer
`vfPhzhyngvir` qrpvqrf ol snzvyl glcr naq fnzcyr anzr. Sbe n fhzznel, gur dhnagvyr fnzcyrf pneel
gur snzvyl'f bja anzr, fb "anzr vf `<snzvyl>_fhz` be `<snzvyl>_pbhag`" rkpyhqrf gurz jvgubhg n
ynory purpx.

Gur erfrg ehyr unf vgf ernfba va n pbzzrag, orpnhfr vg ybbxf yvxr n oht gb n ernqre jub qbrf abg
xabj pbhagref: `vapernfr = f.Inyhr` jura `f.Inyhr < byq`.

`ryncfrq.Frpbaqf()` vf n sybng64, fb fho-frpbaq vagreinyf jbex jvgubhg vagrtre gehapngvba. Gur
`ryncfrq <= 0` purpx pbzrf svefg: qvivqvat ol mreb jbhyq tvir `+Vas` be `AnA` engrf, juvpu ybbx
yvxr qngn vafgrnq bs yvxr n zvfgnxr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Cnefr` vf B(gbgny vachg olgrf) cyhf fbegvat rnpu fnzcyr'f ynoryf (gval). Zrzbel vf gur snzvyvrf
cyhf bar xrl cre frevrf va gur qhcyvpngr frg. `Jevgr` vf yvarne va gur bhgchg. `Engrf` vf
B(|ceri| + |phee|) znc bcrengvbaf, rnpu pbfgvat n `FrevrfXrl` ohvyq.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- "Jul abg `rkcszg`?" Va n erny gbby, hfr vg (be `grkgcnefr`). Gur rkrepvfr vf nobhg ernqvat n
  fcrp vagb n tenzzne, naq gur fgnaqneq yvoenel vf rabhtu.
- "Vf n 64 XvO yvar yvzvg BX?" Sbe n qroht gbby, cebonoyl; pnyy `fp.Ohssre` vs lbhe rkcbegref unir
  uhtr ynory inyhrf.
- "Jung nobhg `\e\a`?" `ohsvb.Fpnaare` qebcf n `\e` orsber `\a`, fb PEYS svyrf cnefr; gur ERNQZR
  yrnirf vg hafcrpvsvrq.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **N pbzznaq**: `uggc.Trg` jvgu n gvzrbhg, `Cnefr(erfc.Obql)`, fyrrc, ntnva, `Engrf`, fbeg gur
  znc'f xrlf ol engr, cevag jvgu `grkg/gnojevgre`.
- **Yvag**: n frpbaq cnff bire gur snzvyvrf (pbhagref jvgubhg `_gbgny`, zvffvat URYC, `yr` inyhrf
  gung qb abg vapernfr be ynpx `+Vas`) gung ergheaf jneavatf vafgrnq bs reebef.
- **BcraZrgevpf**: n qvssrerag fnzcyr-gb-snzvyl ehyr sbe pbhagref (`k_gbgny` naq `k_perngrq`
  orybat gb gur pbhagre `k`), n erdhverq `# RBS`, naq gvzrfgnzcf va frpbaqf. Gur yrkre fgnlf; gur
  snzvyl ynlre punatrf, juvpu fubjf jul gur gjb ynlref jrer jbegu frcnengvat.
